  "bg.book.taglineRule": { en: "Always show the tagline next to the logo on official materials (covers, letterheads, email signatures) — never on its own without brand context. Don't change its wording from one material to another: one tagline, consistent everywhere.", id: "Selalu tampilkan tagline berdampingan dengan logo di materi resmi (cover, kop surat, signature email) — jangan berdiri sendiri tanpa konteks brand. Jangan diubah kata-katanya di berbagai materi; satu tagline, konsisten di mana-mana." },
